    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Answers must be contextualised and grounded in cited sources.  3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To minimize environmental footprint, the firm's renewable-powered infrastructure supports the client's requirement for a low-carbon solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, based on the firm's current technology stack and capabilities as of 2025, the firm's can propose an architecture that meets the client's requirements for response times, availability, resilience, API interfaces, integration, sovereign hosting, and minimal dependency on non-European suppliers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires strict GDPR compliance, personal-data protection, professional secrecy, and confidentiality of client data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also respect the auditor's independence, separation of duties, and anti-money-laundering obligations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's certifications, GDPR instruments, AI security controls, audit capabilities, and experience with EU regulatory frameworks (GDPR, EU AI Act, RGS, SecNumCloud, NIS2) as of 2024, what are the key security and compliance measures our company's should implement to ensure a secure and compliant solution? our company's have ISO 27001 certification since 2023 which covers Development, delivery and operations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "ISO 27001 certification ensures that our company's information security management system is in place to protect sensitive information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our company's ISO 27701 certification provides an extension for privacy information management." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For personal-data protection and GDPR compliance, our company's will implement data encryption both in transit using TLS 1.3 and at rest using AES-256, ensuring that client data is protected from unauthorized access. our company's also have key management infrastructure based in EU to maintain control over encryption keys." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To respect professional secrecy and confidentiality of client data, our company's will implement strict partitioning with logical isolation per client and per mission, along with access controls to prevent any cross-client circulation of data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Pseudonymisation will be used where relevant to further protect sensitive information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assistance in drafting client letters and correspondence, mission notes, file memos and syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding auditor's independence, separation of duties, and anti-money-laundering obligations, our company's experience with regulatory frameworks such as GDPR, anti-money-laundering regulations (LCB-FT), and statutory audit principles will guide the implementation of necessary controls. our company's will ensure that our company's solution does not undermine a firm's reporting obligations under LCB-FT. our company's secure software development lifecycle (SDLC) includes code review, dependency scanning, secrets management, and periodic penetration testing by an external provider equivalent to CREST level." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our secure software development lifecycle (SDLC) ensures that vulnerabilities are identified and remediated promptly according to severity-based SLAs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For audit purposes, our company's maintain a complete audit log of access and system outputs. our company's Data Protection Officer (DPO) appointment and the existence of a data processing register further demonstrate our company's commitment to GDPR compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The availability of a Data Processing Agreement (DPA) aligned with GDPR Article 28 ensures that data processing activities are legally compliant." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given these measures, our company's can ensure a secure and compliant solution that respects all required security, privacy, and regulatory obligations as of our company's reference year 2025." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client demands respect for professional secrecy, confidentiality, and auditor independence." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also comply with regulatory requirements, including GDPR, anti-money-laundering regulations, and legal retention and archival obligations for accounting documents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Considering our company's legal standing, procurement experience across EU jurisdictions, IP model, insurance, standard contractual clauses, and AI regulatory posture (GDPR, EU AI Act) as of 2024, what are the key legal risks our company's should flag, and how can our company's ensure compliance with the key legal risks we should flag?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our company's company context, our company's is a Société par actions simplifiée (SAS) registered in France, which implies that our company's are subject to French law and EU regulations. our company's have experience contracting with private firms, regulated professions, and public-sector clients, including familiarity with professional secrecy expectations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address The client demands, our company's should flag the following key legal risks: 1. **Professional secrecy and confidentiality**: As a provider of an AI assistance solution, our company's must ensure that our company's platform and personnel respect the confidentiality of client data. our company's is familiar with the contractual expectations of clients bound by professional secrecy, which mitigates this risk. 2. **GDPR compliance**: our company's must comply with GDPR when processing client and employee personal and financial data. our company's has experience with GDPR requirements, including Art. 28 processing agreements, which reduces this risk. 3. **Anti-money-laundering regulations**: As a provider of services to a regional accounting and statutory audit firm, our company's may be subject to anti-money-laundering regulations (LCB-FT). our company's should ensure that our company's solution does not compromise a regional accounting and statutory audit firm compliance with anti-money-laundering regulations (LCB-FT). 4. **Auditor independence**: our solution must respect auditor independence and separation-of-duties rules for statutory audit. our company's should design our solution to avoid any potential conflicts of interest or compromising of auditor independence. 5. **Legal retention and archival obligations**: our company's must comply with legal retention and archival obligations for accounting documents, which includes ensuring that our solution does not compromise the client's ability to meet legal retention and archival obligations for accounting documents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution does not autonomously produce binding or signed deliverables; the professional validates.  3.3 Client-file handling support." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure compliance with these requirements, our company's can take the following steps: 1. **Implement robust data protection measures**: Ensure that our company's platform and personnel adhere to strict confidentiality and data protection standards, including encryption and access controls. 2. **Conduct a GDPR impact assessment**: Perform a thorough assessment of our solution GDPR compliance, including data processing agreements and Art. 28 requirements. 3. **Design the solution with auditor independence in mind**: Ensure that our solution respects auditor independence and separation-of-duties rules for statutory audit, avoiding any potential conflicts of interest. 4. **Collaborate with the client on anti-money-laundering regulations**: Work closely with the client to ensure that our solution does not compromise the client compliance with anti-money-laundering regulations (LCB-FT). 5. **Develop a data retention and archival policy**: Establish a policy for retaining and archiving accounting documents, ensuring compliance with legal requirements and avoiding any potential compromises. 6. **Obtain necessary certifications and insurance**: Consider obtaining relevant certifications (e.g., ISO 27001) and maintaining professional liability insurance (currently €10,000,000 per claim) to mitigate potential risks." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By flagging potential risks and taking proactive steps to ensure compliance, our company's can provide a solution that respects the client's demands for professional secrecy, confidentiality, and auditor independence while meeting regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client has allocated a budget of €220,000 over 3 years, with an annual operating cost that must remain controlled." ;
