    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires an artificial-intelligence assistance solution that improves productivity and the quality and reliability of The client professionals' work. an artificial-intelligence assistance solution that improves productivity and the quality and reliability of its professionals' work must provide quick access to reliable, up-to-date information, assist in drafting professional documents, support client-file handling, and facilitate collaboration and mission continuity." ;
