        ex:hasText "As part of a consultation run with a small number of selected vendors, Cabinet Vauclair & Associés wishes to equip The firm’s professionals with an artificial-intelligence assistance solution that improves productivity and the quality and reliability of The firm’s professionals work, while preserving professional secrecy and the reliability of figures — and while remaining strictly a non-decisional support tool.  a consultation run with a small number of selected vendors covers the design, implementation and deployment of such a solution.  2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk45> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "General description of the need  The solution must provide The firm’s professionals with an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from The firm’s professionals work environment, supporting The firm’s professionals in The firm’s professionals daily activities. an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from their work environment, supporting them in their daily activities may notably cover:  -   retrieval of regulatory and methodological information; -   assistance in drafting professional documents; -   support in handling client files; -   support for the continuity of missions between collaborators." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk46> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must fit into existing practices and must not introduce a rupture in Cabinet Vauclair & Associés working methods." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk47> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The chartered accountant or statutory auditor remains the sole validator: no deliverable is produced or signed without professional validation.  3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

