        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk94> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Considering the firm's current technology stack, performance benchmarks, sovereign hosting options, and technical constraints as of 2024, can the firm's propose an architecture that meets these requirements? the firm's can propose an architecture that meets the client's requirements based on the firm's current capabilities. the firm's platform, Atelier, is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform with components such as document ingestion pipeline, vector store, retrieval layer, orchestration layer, and answer layer." ;
